WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:37.600
Episode 9

01:37.620 --> 01:38.880
How did they

01:38.900 --> 01:41.240
move here?

01:41.650 --> 01:43.200
I was afraid

01:43.330 --> 01:45.600
someone else wants to kill them,

01:45.620 --> 01:48.640
so I bought the house.

01:52.450 --> 01:53.370
What if

01:53.370 --> 01:55.170
I really wanted to kill them?

02:00.820 --> 02:02.490
What would you do?

02:06.220 --> 02:07.910
You must be kidding.

02:07.930 --> 02:10.040
I don't dare to do anything.

02:12.700 --> 02:14.450
Your lightness skill is amazing!

02:15.650 --> 02:17.450
I'm nobody.

02:17.450 --> 02:20.170
I'm always at your service.

02:23.900 --> 02:26.260
You're not Teng Zijing's relative or friend,

02:26.260 --> 02:28.340
but you even deceived me

02:28.340 --> 02:30.240
to protect his family.

02:30.260 --> 02:31.090
Wang Qinian.

02:31.090 --> 02:33.610
It's my fault. I'm sorry for my negligence of duty.

02:33.650 --> 02:36.530
You're warm-hearted.

02:37.260 --> 02:38.830
It's perceptive of you to notice that.

02:38.850 --> 02:39.700
I had duck blood soup

02:39.700 --> 02:40.730
with vermicelli for dinner.

02:40.730 --> 02:41.620
It makes me feel warm.

02:41.620 --> 02:42.970
Stop playing the fool.

02:43.620 --> 02:45.610
Your Excellency. Give me a kick.

02:47.260 --> 02:49.250
I hope you've vented your spleen.

02:49.450 --> 02:51.160
You're just a clerk.

02:51.180 --> 02:53.160
It proves the Investigator's Office is full of able persons.

02:53.180 --> 02:54.240
No.

02:54.260 --> 02:56.800
You're the one who's beautiful in mind

02:56.820 --> 02:58.910
and clever in appearance.

02:58.930 --> 02:59.820
What are you talking about?

02:59.820 --> 03:00.710
It doesn't make sense.

03:00.730 --> 03:01.490
Sorry.

03:01.490 --> 03:03.160
I'm poor in expression.

03:03.180 --> 03:04.480
Don't tell anyone

03:04.540 --> 03:05.840
about Teng Zijing's issue.

03:06.540 --> 03:08.450
Teng Zijing?

03:09.570 --> 03:12.240
Wasn't he killed

03:12.260 --> 03:13.270
by you?

03:13.290 --> 03:15.400
Your Excellency, did you forget it?

03:17.700 --> 03:18.990
I'd like to thank you on behalf of him.

03:19.010 --> 03:20.970
Nah. Don't say that.

03:25.180 --> 03:26.070
What is it?

03:26.090 --> 03:27.730
The house

03:27.780 --> 03:29.600
cost me 123 taels of silver.

03:29.620 --> 03:30.970
This is the title deed.

03:31.180 --> 03:32.570
Your Excellency,

03:32.570 --> 03:34.140
we were destined to meet,

03:34.140 --> 03:34.630
right?

03:34.650 --> 03:35.430
Can you round the price up

03:35.450 --> 03:36.780
to 130 taels?

03:36.780 --> 03:38.200
That's too much.

03:39.010 --> 03:40.680
How about 125?

03:40.700 --> 03:41.450
You have to

03:41.450 --> 03:42.350
round it up, anyway.

03:42.370 --> 03:43.120
I save them.

03:43.140 --> 03:44.810
It's worth it, right?

03:44.900 --> 03:45.880
I don't have money with me.

03:45.900 --> 03:46.960
Come to my mansion later.

03:46.980 --> 03:48.200
No way!

03:49.210 --> 03:49.820
I won't give you the title deed

03:49.820 --> 03:51.640
unless you pay me.

03:53.820 --> 03:55.120
Your Excellency,

03:55.650 --> 03:58.120
Guo Baokun works for the Crown Prince.

03:58.140 --> 04:00.140
And his father is powerful.

04:00.140 --> 04:01.880
It's okay you hit him,

04:01.900 --> 04:03.060
but why did you tell him who you are?

04:03.060 --> 04:04.240
I'm afraid

04:04.260 --> 04:06.190
you'll get into trouble.

04:06.210 --> 04:08.090
It's none of his business.

04:08.700 --> 04:10.000
I did it.

04:10.060 --> 04:11.610
I will

04:11.650 --> 04:13.000
accept responsibility for it.

04:17.170 --> 04:18.680
Hey.

04:18.700 --> 04:20.140
You just came back.

04:20.140 --> 04:22.090
Do you want to leave your wife and son again?

04:22.090 --> 04:23.970
Be a good father.

04:24.540 --> 04:25.960
You did it for me.

04:25.980 --> 04:27.130
Stop it.

04:27.490 --> 04:29.070
Make your decision

04:29.090 --> 04:30.720
after you listen to me.

04:30.770 --> 04:31.870
Listen.

04:31.890 --> 04:33.680
Why did I tell Guo Baokun

04:33.700 --> 04:34.700
it's me

04:34.700 --> 04:36.410
when I hit him?

04:37.370 --> 04:38.520
Why?

04:38.540 --> 04:39.960
I did it on purpose.

04:39.980 --> 04:42.000
I don't want to marry Lin Wan'er.

04:42.020 --> 04:43.460
Only by making big trouble

04:43.460 --> 04:44.540
can I break off the marriage contract.

04:44.540 --> 04:45.170
Then I'll

04:45.170 --> 04:47.250
marry Lady Drumstick.

04:47.580 --> 04:48.210
So,

04:48.210 --> 04:49.280
it has nothing to do with you.

04:49.300 --> 04:50.480
Don't be moved.

04:51.020 --> 04:52.370
Why did you help me?

04:52.740 --> 04:54.120
As I said,

04:54.140 --> 04:55.030
I did it to break off my marriage contract.

04:55.050 --> 04:56.480
Why did you help me?

04:57.580 --> 05:00.630
I want to help my friend. Can't I?

05:00.650 --> 05:02.400
There is a big difference between us.

05:02.420 --> 05:03.610
Your father is Earl Sinan

05:03.610 --> 05:04.890
and you're the Director-General of the Investigator's Office,

05:04.890 --> 05:07.020
but I'm just an ordinary being.

05:07.020 --> 05:08.700
Do you know there is a stone tablet

05:08.700 --> 05:09.720
at the gate of the Investigator's Office?

05:09.740 --> 05:11.130
Yes.

05:11.170 --> 05:12.280
It says

05:12.300 --> 05:13.540
men are created equal

05:13.540 --> 05:14.840
and there is neither lowliness nor nobleness.

05:14.860 --> 05:15.630
Nobody believes that.

05:15.650 --> 05:16.810
I do.

05:16.860 --> 05:18.190
But in this case...

05:18.210 --> 05:19.400
All right. Guys,

05:19.420 --> 05:21.190
so much for this.

05:21.210 --> 05:23.570
I'll get you a false identity tomorrow.

05:24.460 --> 05:25.640
Now,

05:25.740 --> 05:28.920
I have to go back to the brothel.

05:39.490 --> 05:41.160
His Excellency

05:41.580 --> 05:44.010
is really something else.

05:46.770 --> 05:48.290
Thank you for what you did.

05:48.860 --> 05:50.130
You're welcome.

05:52.300 --> 05:54.040
130 taels of silver.

06:47.930 --> 06:49.880
When I pulled out your hair clasp,

06:50.370 --> 06:52.470
I put a hair on your shoulder

06:52.490 --> 06:54.880
after tying a knot.

06:55.540 --> 06:57.010
Your pose remains unchanged,

06:57.210 --> 06:59.130
but the hair is gone.

06:59.490 --> 07:00.720
You woke up.

07:07.020 --> 07:09.040
You can keep your breath under control,

07:09.090 --> 07:11.290
but you can't control your heartbeat.

07:11.890 --> 07:14.810
Your pulse is fast. You're nervous.

07:20.930 --> 07:23.040
You even know how to feel the pulse.

07:24.050 --> 07:25.590
It's nothing.

07:25.610 --> 07:27.440
I can be considered a doctor, anyway.

07:27.490 --> 07:29.280
But the hair thing is false.

07:29.300 --> 07:30.750
You took the bait easily.

07:30.770 --> 07:32.370
You should've been more careful.

07:34.650 --> 07:37.290
You're versatile!

07:39.090 --> 07:40.680
It usually takes some time

07:40.700 --> 07:41.610
for a person to come around

07:41.610 --> 07:42.870
after being drugged by me,

07:42.890 --> 07:44.800
unless they've been taking such drugs

07:44.820 --> 07:47.010
so that drug resistance happens.

07:48.890 --> 07:50.480
Drug resistance?

07:51.700 --> 07:53.570
I've never

07:53.820 --> 07:55.720
heard of this phrase.

07:57.980 --> 07:59.810
Who on earth are you?

08:01.300 --> 08:03.320
Where did you go at midnight?

08:06.260 --> 08:07.530
How about like this?

08:08.330 --> 08:10.320
I won't ask you about your background.

08:12.740 --> 08:14.520
I won't tell anyone

08:14.540 --> 08:16.720
you once went out.

08:17.420 --> 08:18.970
All I remember is

08:21.300 --> 08:23.850
one night with you on my bed.

09:05.050 --> 09:06.650
Fan!

09:08.970 --> 09:11.440
Did you have a good time last night?

09:11.460 --> 09:12.610
I almost can't walk now.

09:12.610 --> 09:14.370
I need to catch up on my sleep when I go home.

09:14.610 --> 09:15.470
Go ahead.

09:15.490 --> 09:16.770
See you around.

09:28.610 --> 09:31.150
He wasn't on the boat last night.

09:31.170 --> 09:33.280
I saw him leave,

09:33.580 --> 09:36.480
but I don't know where he went.

09:37.530 --> 09:38.680
He punched a guy.

09:38.700 --> 09:40.080
What?

09:40.290 --> 09:41.260
That's why

09:41.260 --> 09:42.370
I rushed here.

09:42.370 --> 09:45.520
Fan Xian punched Guo Baokun last night.

09:47.290 --> 09:50.040
It's something serious.

10:11.660 --> 10:13.160
So,

10:13.820 --> 10:16.440
are you here for Fan Xian?

10:16.460 --> 10:17.710
Yes.

10:17.730 --> 10:19.210
Sorry for any inconvenience.

10:19.290 --> 10:21.470
Someone accused him of doing violence.

10:21.490 --> 10:22.920
He's not home.

10:23.100 --> 10:24.510
Madam,

10:24.530 --> 10:25.880
we're ordered by the Magistrate

10:25.900 --> 10:27.240
to do it.

10:27.260 --> 10:28.510
You should go look for him.

10:28.530 --> 10:30.080
If it's okay,

10:30.100 --> 10:31.100
we'd like to

10:31.100 --> 10:32.400
search your mansion.

10:32.460 --> 10:33.170
It's not okay.

10:33.170 --> 10:34.270
Madam,

10:34.290 --> 10:35.640
we're under orders.

10:35.660 --> 10:37.130
Show them the door!

10:46.490 --> 10:48.650
There are visitors in the early morning.

10:50.290 --> 10:50.900
Fan Xian!

10:50.900 --> 10:52.770
Catch him!

10:55.580 --> 10:56.410
Go away!

10:56.410 --> 10:58.920
I am here!

10:59.780 --> 11:01.130
Get lost.

11:05.660 --> 11:06.510
I am here.

11:06.530 --> 11:07.580
I won't let them hurt you.

11:07.580 --> 11:09.470
What an awe-inspiring general!

11:09.490 --> 11:11.910
It's nothing. Don't mention it.

11:11.930 --> 11:14.960
Let me wipe them out!

11:15.290 --> 11:16.830
-Get lost! -Mr. Fan.

11:16.850 --> 11:17.530
Go!

11:17.530 --> 11:18.920
Second Young Master.

11:21.140 --> 11:23.100
All of you, get lost!

11:23.100 --> 11:23.900
Second Young Master.

11:23.900 --> 11:24.490
Cut the crap.

11:24.490 --> 11:25.780
Quick. Go away.

11:25.780 --> 11:26.920
Go away.

11:27.370 --> 11:29.280
Do you know where you are?

11:29.490 --> 11:31.080
I'm pissed off at the sight of you.

11:31.100 --> 11:32.370
It's the Fan Mansion. Got it?

11:32.370 --> 11:33.470
We're under orders.

11:33.490 --> 11:34.700
What? Under orders?

11:34.700 --> 11:35.760
Do you know who I am?

11:35.780 --> 11:36.900
I'm Fan Sizhe.

11:36.900 --> 11:38.000
Stop it.

11:38.020 --> 11:39.280
You want to fight back?

11:39.460 --> 11:41.840
You go to catch Fan Xian!

11:43.490 --> 11:44.770
Guards!

11:46.410 --> 11:48.130
Let's see if we'll outnumber you.

11:50.340 --> 11:51.890
Catch all of them!

11:52.930 --> 11:55.890
Enough. Stop it.

11:57.780 --> 11:59.480
I won't make things difficult for you.

11:59.530 --> 12:01.020
Tell me why

12:01.020 --> 12:02.770
you want to catch Fan Xian.

12:06.170 --> 12:07.450
Madam,

12:07.490 --> 12:08.700
he hit Guo Baokun

12:08.700 --> 12:10.370
last night.

12:10.370 --> 12:11.480
Impossible.

12:11.820 --> 12:13.830
Fan Xian was at home last night.

12:13.850 --> 12:15.120
He didn't go out.

12:15.140 --> 12:15.730
But the Guo mansion

12:15.730 --> 12:17.240
sent a written complaint this morning

12:17.260 --> 12:18.640
which says clearly

12:18.660 --> 12:20.440
it's Young Master Fan Xian.

12:20.460 --> 12:23.570
Do you mean I was lying?

12:23.930 --> 12:24.950
Madam,

12:24.970 --> 12:26.290
no matter it's him or not,

12:26.290 --> 12:27.370
we need to take him

12:27.370 --> 12:28.350
to the prefecture

12:28.370 --> 12:29.810
to make things clear.

12:29.970 --> 12:32.030
Who sent the written complaint?

12:32.050 --> 12:33.150
The butler of the Guo mansion.

12:33.170 --> 12:34.390
You want to take away

12:34.410 --> 12:35.660
a Young Master of the Fan family

12:35.660 --> 12:36.830
just because of a butler's complaint?

12:36.850 --> 12:38.480
Let me tell you something.

12:38.580 --> 12:39.290
Fan Xian will

12:39.290 --> 12:41.690
go to the Prefecture of Capital City

12:41.850 --> 12:43.370
only when the plaintiff

12:43.370 --> 12:45.160
goes there.

12:45.290 --> 12:46.370
By then, Fan Xian will

12:46.370 --> 12:48.450
go to confront him.

12:48.970 --> 12:49.910
You can leave.

12:49.930 --> 12:51.120
Madam Liu Ruyu,

12:51.140 --> 12:52.440
it's against the rules.

12:52.460 --> 12:54.520
I'm following the rules of the Fan family.

12:55.660 --> 12:57.510
Go away!

12:57.530 --> 12:58.440
Get lost!

12:58.460 --> 12:59.830
Want to rebel?

12:59.850 --> 13:01.290
Go away! Go away! Go away!

13:01.290 --> 13:02.400
Quick.

13:02.660 --> 13:03.640
Quick.

13:03.660 --> 13:04.920
Go away.

13:05.260 --> 13:06.890
I'll keep hitting if you stay here.

13:18.660 --> 13:20.760
Tell me the truth. Did you hit him?

13:20.780 --> 13:21.920
Yes.

13:22.610 --> 13:23.410
I'll prepare

13:23.410 --> 13:24.590
a large amount of money

13:24.610 --> 13:26.030
to get it fixed.

13:26.050 --> 13:28.200
It's no big deal.

13:28.220 --> 13:29.560
He's seriously injured.

13:29.580 --> 13:30.810
How seriously?

13:42.560 --> 13:44.630
=Guo Youzhi, Nanqing Minister of the Board of Rites=

13:50.820 --> 13:52.150
Your Excellency,

13:52.170 --> 13:53.710
Young Master is seriously injured.

13:53.730 --> 13:55.770
How can they ask him to go to the prefecture?

13:57.970 --> 13:59.140
It's ridiculous!

13:59.140 --> 14:01.720
His Majesty trusts Fan Jian,

14:01.970 --> 14:03.690
so I can't use force.

14:05.930 --> 14:07.840
Kun'er has to show up

14:09.050 --> 14:10.840
to push Fan Xian to go to the prefecture.

14:11.020 --> 14:12.480
I'll go. (Chinese pronunciation: Wo qu)

14:14.700 --> 14:16.680
Kun'er, what did you say?

14:16.700 --> 14:18.220
I'll go.

14:18.220 --> 14:20.370
Five seven, five seven. (Chinese Pronunciation: Wu qi, wu qi)

14:22.220 --> 14:23.200
My wife. (Chinese pronunciation: Wu qi)

14:23.220 --> 14:24.220
He must want to

14:24.220 --> 14:25.240
see his wife.

14:25.260 --> 14:26.530
Come on.

14:26.530 --> 14:27.900
I said, I'll go!

14:27.900 --> 14:29.470
He's not married.

14:29.490 --> 14:31.480
He doesn't have a wife.

14:33.700 --> 14:36.370
I'll go.

14:36.780 --> 14:37.910
You want to go?

14:37.930 --> 14:39.810
Yes.

14:41.460 --> 14:42.830
You're seriously injured.

14:42.850 --> 14:44.350
You'll suffer more pain

14:44.370 --> 14:45.660
if we carry you there.

14:45.660 --> 14:47.450
Are you sure?

14:50.610 --> 14:53.370
You must hate Fan Xian very much.

14:53.970 --> 14:56.960
Yes.

14:58.660 --> 15:01.720
He's playing with fire.

15:04.050 --> 15:05.330
Come.

15:08.780 --> 15:10.160
It's not good for me

15:10.700 --> 15:12.720
to get involved.

15:13.410 --> 15:15.590
Get the best lawyer in the capital city.

15:15.610 --> 15:16.800
I won't leave this matter

15:16.820 --> 15:18.370
at that.

15:18.370 --> 15:19.570
Your Excellency,

15:20.930 --> 15:22.480
I worked as a lawyer

15:22.700 --> 15:24.320
before I came to the capital city.

15:24.340 --> 15:24.850
I've never lost a case

15:24.850 --> 15:26.600
over the years.

15:27.290 --> 15:29.920
Let me get it fixed for you.

15:31.660 --> 15:33.250
I have only one requirement.

15:34.170 --> 15:37.510
Let Fan Xian pay the price

15:37.530 --> 15:39.400
with his life!

15:41.370 --> 15:43.850
Kill him!

15:43.850 --> 15:44.950
Is it so serious?

15:44.970 --> 15:46.370
I lost control of myself.

15:46.820 --> 15:48.400
You'll be in trouble.

15:48.660 --> 15:50.020
His father will put you into prison

15:50.020 --> 15:51.720
to save face.

15:51.850 --> 15:53.730
And he himself works for the Crown Prince,

15:53.730 --> 15:55.570
who couldn't turn a blind eye to it.

15:56.660 --> 15:57.260
You don't look like

15:57.260 --> 15:58.610
an impulsive guy.

15:58.610 --> 16:00.170
It's not been long since you came here.

16:00.170 --> 16:01.820
How could you make such a big trouble?

16:01.820 --> 16:03.100
He must have died

16:03.100 --> 16:04.810
if I were impulsive.

16:05.050 --> 16:06.200
You pack up

16:06.220 --> 16:07.520
and go back to Danzhou.

16:08.020 --> 16:09.200
They could do nothing

16:09.220 --> 16:10.960
if they can't find you.

16:11.530 --> 16:13.010
Why do you help me?

16:17.290 --> 16:18.490
My surname is Liu,

16:18.490 --> 16:20.390
but I'm a member of the Fan family.

16:20.410 --> 16:21.830
Now I believe it's not you

16:21.850 --> 16:24.040
that plotted the assassination in Danzhou.

16:25.700 --> 16:27.010
Cut the crap.

16:27.580 --> 16:28.760
Lose no time.

16:28.780 --> 16:29.590
You have to leave now.

16:29.610 --> 16:30.970
I've had some money prepared

16:30.970 --> 16:32.200
in the backyard.

16:32.220 --> 16:33.590
-You... -Madam.

16:33.610 --> 16:34.680
I have to stay.

16:34.700 --> 16:35.850
To go to the prefecture?

16:35.850 --> 16:36.490
It's okay.

16:36.490 --> 16:38.520
How can I let you do that?

16:40.610 --> 16:42.160
You want to

16:42.220 --> 16:44.400
make it bigger, don't you?

16:46.340 --> 16:48.280
It pissed me off!

16:50.370 --> 16:51.590
What are you doing?

16:51.610 --> 16:53.320
Where is my broom?

16:53.340 --> 16:54.660
Why do you need it?

16:54.660 --> 16:57.170
Mom, those constables are here again.

16:57.170 --> 16:58.730
They said Guo Baokun has been carried to the prefecture.

16:58.730 --> 17:00.510
They asked Fan Xian to confront him.

17:00.530 --> 17:01.800
I'll drive them away.

17:01.820 --> 17:02.920
Don't bother.

17:03.490 --> 17:04.890
I'll go there.

17:16.890 --> 17:17.500
Step aside!

17:17.500 --> 17:18.750
Excuse me.

17:18.770 --> 17:19.930
Excuse me.

17:19.930 --> 17:21.080
Excuse me, everyone.

17:21.100 --> 17:23.130
I have to go to the prefecture.

17:34.860 --> 17:36.560
Your Highness,

17:37.700 --> 17:39.910
Guo Baokun has supported you

17:39.930 --> 17:42.080
for a long time.

17:42.410 --> 17:44.720
He is seriously injured this time.

17:45.130 --> 17:47.080
You won't look on and do nothing, right?

17:48.170 --> 17:49.960
Everything has to be done according to law.

17:49.980 --> 17:53.010
Whether I go or not makes no difference.

17:53.050 --> 17:54.320
You're the Crown Prince.

17:54.340 --> 17:56.010
It makes a big difference.

17:56.130 --> 17:58.080
If Fan Xian is declared guilty,

17:58.380 --> 17:59.720
maybe His Majesty

17:59.740 --> 18:01.750
won't let Wan'er marry him.

18:01.770 --> 18:03.050
Then

18:03.220 --> 18:05.030
you can keep

18:05.050 --> 18:07.650
using Neiku to your advantage.

18:07.700 --> 18:09.030
If you don't show up,

18:09.050 --> 18:11.320
you'll let your subordinates down.

18:25.100 --> 18:26.720
Now that you said so,

18:26.740 --> 18:28.200
I'll go there.

19:36.760 --> 19:36.890
=Mei Zhili, Imperial Magistrate of Prefecture of Capital City=

19:36.890 --> 19:38.380
=Mei Zhili, Imperial Magistrate of Prefecture of Capital City=
Tell me your name.

19:38.380 --> 19:39.080
=Mei Zhili, Imperial Magistrate of Prefecture of Capital City=

19:39.100 --> 19:40.320
Your Excellency,

19:40.340 --> 19:42.080
I'm He Zongwei.

19:42.100 --> 19:44.200
I'm the plaintiff attorney.

19:45.890 --> 19:47.200
I'm Fan Xian.

19:47.460 --> 19:49.270
Fan Xian, do you know your sin?

19:49.290 --> 19:50.770
Completely don't know.

19:51.740 --> 19:54.050
Come. Show him

19:54.050 --> 19:55.560
the written complaint.

20:09.130 --> 20:10.290
Why does it say

20:10.290 --> 20:12.560
I hit Mr. Guo Baokun?

20:12.700 --> 20:14.560
Do you have any question?

20:14.620 --> 20:15.500
Can you tell me

20:15.500 --> 20:16.410
where Mr. Guo is?

20:16.410 --> 20:19.680
Mr. Fan, please look here.

20:24.740 --> 20:26.560
I was wondering

20:29.860 --> 20:31.530
what it is.

20:33.460 --> 20:35.250
Is it a human?

20:36.460 --> 20:37.620
Your Excellency,

20:37.620 --> 20:38.500
he injured Mr. Guo so severely

20:38.500 --> 20:39.720
that he has to be wrapped like this,

20:39.740 --> 20:41.440
but he's still making sarcastic remarks.

20:41.620 --> 20:42.530
I just said it's a human.

20:42.530 --> 20:43.910
Why do you think it's sarcasm?

20:43.930 --> 20:45.770
Do you mean it's not a human?

20:47.860 --> 20:49.110
He's violent and wicked.

20:49.130 --> 20:51.170
Please give him a heavier punishment.

20:51.170 --> 20:52.770
Hold on.

20:55.170 --> 20:56.960
It says

20:56.980 --> 20:57.930
all the servants fainted

20:57.930 --> 20:59.890
after being drugged at that time.

21:00.220 --> 21:01.170
And Guo Baokun was hit

21:01.170 --> 21:02.840
while his head was covered in a bag.

21:04.010 --> 21:06.230
Now that there were no witnesses,

21:06.250 --> 21:07.800
why did you say it's me?

21:07.860 --> 21:10.150
Because he heard your voice.

21:10.170 --> 21:10.740
What did I say?

21:10.740 --> 21:11.720
You told him who you are.

21:11.740 --> 21:12.770
Why did I do that?

21:12.770 --> 21:13.580
Villains are often swollen with arrogance

21:13.580 --> 21:14.720
when they do violence.

21:14.740 --> 21:16.220
Now that I told him who I am,

21:16.220 --> 21:17.030
why did I cover his head

21:17.050 --> 21:18.110
in a bag?

21:18.130 --> 21:18.820
Isn't it

21:18.820 --> 21:20.010
inconsistent?

21:20.010 --> 21:20.860
Because you want to use this

21:20.860 --> 21:22.930
as an excuse to clear your name.

21:23.050 --> 21:24.750
If I guess right,

21:24.770 --> 21:27.290
you'll say someone else did it in your name.

21:27.930 --> 21:28.720
Your Excellency,

21:28.740 --> 21:29.720
he just said

21:29.740 --> 21:30.960
it's someone else that did it.

21:30.980 --> 21:32.320
You can make a decision.

21:35.050 --> 21:35.870
Look.

21:35.890 --> 21:37.800
Mr. Guo also agrees.

21:37.820 --> 21:39.130
Now that nobody

21:39.130 --> 21:40.530
saw the assailant...

21:40.530 --> 21:41.680
Your Excellency,

21:42.580 --> 21:44.580
the assailant recited

21:44.580 --> 21:46.050
a poem when he hit Mr. Guo.

21:50.500 --> 21:52.580
"A thousand miles from home, I'm grieved at autumn's plight."

21:52.580 --> 21:55.250
"I'll now and then for years, alone I'm on this height."

21:55.460 --> 21:56.320
Good lines of verse!

21:56.320 --> 21:56.460
=Guo Baokun, the son of Nanqing Minister of the Board of Rites=
Good lines of verse!

21:56.460 --> 21:56.650
=Guo Baokun, the son of Nanqing Minister of the Board of Rites=

21:56.650 --> 21:57.360
=Guo Baokun, the son of Nanqing Minister of the Board of Rites=
Your Excellency,

21:57.360 --> 21:57.720
Your Excellency,

21:57.740 --> 21:58.630
a poetry gathering was held yesterday

21:58.650 --> 21:59.870
in Prince Jing's mansion,

21:59.890 --> 22:01.440
where Fan Xian wrote a poem.

22:01.460 --> 22:03.360
The two lines of verse are part of it.

22:03.380 --> 22:04.480
The assailant recited it

22:04.500 --> 22:05.740
when he hit Mr. Guo.

22:05.740 --> 22:07.480
It proves

22:07.650 --> 22:09.600
Fan Xian is the assailant.

22:14.170 --> 22:15.720
It makes sense.

22:17.620 --> 22:18.800
Your Excellency,

22:19.220 --> 22:20.750
do I look stupid?

22:20.770 --> 22:24.800
I don't think so. You're skilled in debate.

22:24.820 --> 22:26.700
Then why did I

22:26.700 --> 22:27.820
recite my poem

22:27.820 --> 22:28.700
while hitting him?

22:28.700 --> 22:29.290
Obviously,

22:29.290 --> 22:30.930
someone wants to make me a scapegoat.

22:31.700 --> 22:33.560
It was written yesterday.

22:33.580 --> 22:34.620
Who else knew it?

22:34.620 --> 22:36.440
There were lots of people at the poetry gathering.

22:36.460 --> 22:37.720
They all heard me recite it.

22:38.050 --> 22:39.800
Fan Xian, can you tell me

22:42.740 --> 22:45.530
where you were last night?

22:47.700 --> 22:49.360
To be honest,

22:49.380 --> 22:51.440
I went to a brothel

22:51.530 --> 22:52.720
last night.

22:52.740 --> 22:54.170
Can anyone give witness?

22:54.340 --> 22:55.840
Both Li Hongcheng, Prince Jing's son,

22:55.860 --> 22:56.910
and Si Lili from Joy Tsin House

22:56.930 --> 22:58.200
can do that.

22:58.220 --> 23:00.200
Your Excellency, please summon them.

23:00.220 --> 23:01.820
Why did you get

23:01.820 --> 23:03.150
Prince Jing's son involved?

23:03.170 --> 23:04.600
The assailant is savage and cruel.

23:04.620 --> 23:06.110
Mr. Guo Youzhi also takes it seriously.

23:06.130 --> 23:08.650
Please do your utmost.

23:12.170 --> 23:13.530
Did you hear that?

23:13.580 --> 23:15.410
Take the witnesses here.

23:17.740 --> 23:18.700
It's beautiful.

23:18.700 --> 23:19.500
Where is it made?

23:19.500 --> 23:20.630
Really?

23:20.650 --> 23:21.800
Look at the patterns.

23:21.820 --> 23:23.290
It's bright-colored.

23:23.290 --> 23:24.930
-I also want to... -Sister.

23:27.170 --> 23:29.250
Who is he?

23:29.820 --> 23:31.680
Excuse me.

23:31.700 --> 23:33.840
Who is he? Why did he break in?

23:33.860 --> 23:36.170
I think he's her younger brother.

23:37.340 --> 23:38.840
Come over.

23:41.740 --> 23:44.220
Sister, Fan Xian has gone to the prefecture.

23:44.220 --> 23:45.460
You don't know that, right?

23:45.460 --> 23:46.340
I did.

23:46.340 --> 23:48.290
Aren't you worried about it?

23:48.290 --> 23:49.170
You've been getting well

23:49.170 --> 23:50.720
along with him.

23:51.250 --> 23:54.010
I didn't expect to see you get worried.

23:54.500 --> 23:56.740
My bookstore totally relies on him.

23:56.740 --> 23:57.910
Of course I'm worried.

23:57.930 --> 23:59.440
But it's no use.

23:59.890 --> 24:01.480
What should we do?

24:01.500 --> 24:02.840
To get him out of trouble.

24:02.980 --> 24:03.890
But you're chatting

24:03.890 --> 24:05.030
with them over tea.

24:05.050 --> 24:06.720
Can you get him out by doing that?

24:08.250 --> 24:09.650
Follow me.

24:12.890 --> 24:14.110
Their families or relatives

24:14.130 --> 24:15.620
are senior officials.

24:15.620 --> 24:17.380
They're all fascinated by "Red Mansions".

24:17.380 --> 24:18.630
I told them

24:18.650 --> 24:21.130
it's Fan Xian that wrote it.

24:21.170 --> 24:22.080
Sister,

24:22.100 --> 24:23.560
it's urgent.

24:23.580 --> 24:25.600
What's the point of mentioning the book?

24:26.290 --> 24:27.500
Mei Zhili, the Imperial Magistrate,

24:27.500 --> 24:28.980
is responsible for the case.

24:28.980 --> 24:31.770
His daughter is also here.

24:32.460 --> 24:34.110
She promised me

24:34.130 --> 24:36.050
she'd plead with her dad.

24:36.460 --> 24:38.620
It may not work in a short time,

24:38.620 --> 24:40.110
but it'll make a difference

24:40.130 --> 24:41.460
if she makes a scene

24:41.460 --> 24:42.990
or even threatens to commit suicide.

24:43.010 --> 24:46.290
Then Mei Zhili is bound to give in.

24:48.860 --> 24:50.230
But,

24:50.250 --> 24:51.960
are you sure

24:51.980 --> 24:53.650
she'll do as you say?

24:54.500 --> 24:56.680
I'll try my best to persuade her.

24:56.700 --> 24:58.750
You also have a task.

24:58.770 --> 25:00.080
I'm also a little worried.

25:00.250 --> 25:02.440
If the result comes out today,

25:02.580 --> 25:04.360
it'll be too late to do all this.

25:04.380 --> 25:05.390
Yeah.

25:05.410 --> 25:06.800
What to do now?

25:06.820 --> 25:07.750
Go to the Prefecture of Capital City

25:07.770 --> 25:09.630
and keep waiting outside.

25:09.650 --> 25:10.910
Once the result is against Fan Xian,

25:10.930 --> 25:12.100
you have to rush in to save him.

25:12.100 --> 25:13.320
Okay.

25:14.620 --> 25:15.890
Sister,

25:16.100 --> 25:17.440
you asked me

25:17.460 --> 25:18.680
to rush in alone

25:18.700 --> 25:20.030
to save him?

25:20.050 --> 25:22.600
Don't worry. I've made preparations.

25:26.890 --> 25:28.600
Ruoruo, where are you going?

25:28.620 --> 25:29.500
Wait for me for a while.

25:29.500 --> 25:30.840
I'll be back soon.

25:34.770 --> 25:35.870
Sister,

25:35.890 --> 25:37.770
what is it?

25:39.100 --> 25:40.030
With your bare hands,

25:40.050 --> 25:41.600
you couldn't do anything.

25:48.460 --> 25:49.720
It...

25:50.530 --> 25:52.130
It's suitable for you.

25:52.460 --> 25:53.680
Okay.

25:54.290 --> 25:56.320
Once the result is against Fan Xian,

25:57.380 --> 25:59.290
I'll rush in and kill them with it.

26:01.650 --> 26:03.270
It's as sure as fate.

26:03.290 --> 26:05.580
Mr. Fan and I stayed at Joy Tsin House last night.

26:05.580 --> 26:07.370
We had a good talk while drinking.

26:09.410 --> 26:10.890
Your Highness,

26:11.290 --> 26:12.750
can you tell me

26:12.770 --> 26:15.200
if you were with Fan Xian at midnight?

26:15.620 --> 26:17.390
At that time,

26:17.410 --> 26:19.580
Mr. Fan and Miss Si

26:19.580 --> 26:21.200
went to the room.

26:21.700 --> 26:23.440
Thank you, Your Highness.

26:26.620 --> 26:28.200
Miss Si Lili.

26:29.700 --> 26:31.230
Here I am.

26:31.250 --> 26:33.370
Was Fan Xian in your room last night?

26:34.770 --> 26:36.250
Yes.

26:36.860 --> 26:40.170
Did he leave at midnight?

26:45.050 --> 26:47.010
Night hours are extremely precious.

26:48.250 --> 26:50.440
Mr. Fan couldn't be considered a man

26:50.620 --> 26:53.480
if he had left, right?

26:56.410 --> 26:57.360
Miss Si,

26:57.380 --> 27:00.080
you have to tell the truth.

27:00.290 --> 27:01.840
Mr. Fan was in my room

27:01.860 --> 27:04.370
last night.

27:05.010 --> 27:06.600
I don't dare to hide the truth.

27:09.740 --> 27:11.150
Now that they're here to give witness,

27:11.170 --> 27:12.050
it seems

27:12.050 --> 27:14.980
it's someone else

27:14.980 --> 27:16.510
that attacked Mr. Guo.

27:16.530 --> 27:17.800
In this case,

27:17.820 --> 27:19.680
Mr. Fan

27:19.700 --> 27:21.340
has spared himself from suspicion.

27:21.340 --> 27:23.290
I think I can close...

27:23.290 --> 27:24.770
Your Excellency!

27:25.290 --> 27:26.100
What's the matter?

27:26.100 --> 27:27.960
Here arrives the Crown Prince!

27:41.010 --> 27:44.440
Mr. Guo, Fan Xian is dead meat.

28:12.820 --> 28:13.870
What are you doing?

28:13.890 --> 28:15.110
Slant it a little.

28:15.130 --> 28:17.050
One in the front and the other behind.

28:17.930 --> 28:19.480
Hurry up.

28:20.620 --> 28:22.370
Hold it up.

28:35.980 --> 28:41.130
Your servant kowtows upon seeing Your Highness.

28:49.620 --> 28:50.800
We're a family.

28:50.820 --> 28:51.960
Rise.

28:51.980 --> 28:53.600
Thank you, Your Highness.

28:54.340 --> 28:55.800
Mr. Mei.

28:56.050 --> 28:57.560
Rise.

28:58.100 --> 29:00.320
Thank you, Your Highness.

29:01.250 --> 29:02.720
Why are you here?

29:02.740 --> 29:04.390
To watch you try the case.

29:04.410 --> 29:05.560
It makes me terrified.

29:05.580 --> 29:06.840
It...

29:06.930 --> 29:09.290
Your Highness, please take a seat there.

29:30.460 --> 29:31.770
Take a seat.

29:34.250 --> 29:35.480
Sit.

29:36.380 --> 29:37.290
I don't dare to.

29:37.290 --> 29:38.250
Mei Zhili.

29:38.250 --> 29:39.200
Here.

29:39.220 --> 29:41.510
You're the Imperial Magistrate.

29:41.530 --> 29:43.290
Don't forget it.

29:44.890 --> 29:46.410
Yes, Your Highness.

29:49.700 --> 29:51.250
All rise.

29:53.860 --> 29:56.890
I mean them, not you.

29:57.650 --> 29:59.750
Continue with your work. Don't mind me.

29:59.770 --> 30:01.930
Yes, Your Highness.

30:09.130 --> 30:10.480
Your Highness,

30:11.010 --> 30:12.560
the trial is finished.

30:12.580 --> 30:13.990
Finished?

30:14.010 --> 30:15.530
Mr. Mei is going to close it.

30:15.650 --> 30:17.290
I'm spared from suspicion.

30:18.460 --> 30:20.130
There are witnesses.

30:20.740 --> 30:22.150
Who are they?

30:22.170 --> 30:26.250
Prince Jing's son and Si Lili.

30:27.290 --> 30:29.580
Hongcheng is a member of the royal family.

30:29.580 --> 30:31.580
I believe what he said.

30:31.580 --> 30:33.680
As for the woman,

30:33.820 --> 30:35.680
who is she?

30:35.820 --> 30:37.500
Your Highness,

30:37.500 --> 30:40.200
she's a courtesan from Joy Tsin House.

30:42.130 --> 30:44.110
Mei Zhili.

30:44.130 --> 30:45.930
Here.

30:47.650 --> 30:48.960
Here.

30:49.460 --> 30:51.840
Who will lose face

30:52.100 --> 30:54.560
when an Imperial Complier is hit?

30:55.050 --> 30:56.990
It's the royal family!

30:57.010 --> 30:57.990
Got it.

30:58.010 --> 30:59.740
She's of humble origin.

30:59.740 --> 31:01.100
How can you accept what she said

31:01.100 --> 31:03.200
as evidence?

31:03.220 --> 31:04.870
In my opinion,

31:04.890 --> 31:07.530
it has to be investigated strictly.

31:08.770 --> 31:09.860
What do you think?

31:09.860 --> 31:12.100
Your Highness, you're right.

31:12.100 --> 31:13.600
Absolutely.

31:24.740 --> 31:26.030
Si Lili,

31:26.050 --> 31:28.270
Your testimony is confusing.

31:28.290 --> 31:28.910
Guards!

31:28.930 --> 31:29.870
Here.

31:29.890 --> 31:31.250
Get instruments of torture.

31:40.890 --> 31:42.560
Master, why are you back so late?

31:42.580 --> 31:44.080
Fan Xian is still at the Prefecture of Capital City.

31:44.100 --> 31:44.800
I knew.

31:44.820 --> 31:46.290
Then why don't you go there?

31:46.290 --> 31:47.960
Are you worried about him?

31:53.220 --> 31:54.750
If he's declared guilty,

31:54.770 --> 31:56.840
the Fan family will lose face.

31:56.860 --> 31:58.980
He's at the Prefecture of Capital City.

31:58.980 --> 32:01.200
As Assistant Minister of Revenue,

32:01.220 --> 32:03.320
how can I go there?

32:03.340 --> 32:05.110
So you'll turn a blind eye to it?

32:05.130 --> 32:06.560
Of course not.

32:06.580 --> 32:09.320
The situation is unclear.

32:09.340 --> 32:10.680
We have to wait patiently.

32:10.700 --> 32:12.650
It's worrying.

32:13.050 --> 32:14.600
I just got news

32:14.620 --> 32:16.480
that the Crown Prince has gone there.

32:16.500 --> 32:18.510
Guo Baokun works for him.

32:18.530 --> 32:20.410
He must be there to pressure Mei Zhili

32:20.410 --> 32:21.580
to declare Fan Xian guilty.

32:21.580 --> 32:22.840
I knew.

32:23.410 --> 32:24.960
Don't panic.

32:24.980 --> 32:26.530
Besides the Crown Prince,

32:26.530 --> 32:28.720
someone else has also gone there.

32:30.890 --> 32:32.380
But who can stand up to the Crown Prince

32:32.380 --> 32:33.840
as an equal?

32:35.380 --> 32:36.500
Is it...

32:36.500 --> 32:40.270
Fan Xian is closely connected with Neiku.

32:40.290 --> 32:42.650
He's been in the teeth of storms

32:42.650 --> 32:45.200
since he came to the capital city.

32:45.620 --> 32:47.560
His fate

32:47.580 --> 32:50.770
depends on what he can do.

32:50.820 --> 32:52.770
What if the result is bad?

32:53.010 --> 32:55.840
In this case,

32:57.100 --> 32:59.390
I'll help him survive, anyway.

32:59.410 --> 33:00.630
How?

33:00.650 --> 33:03.050
You're just Assistant Minister of Ministry of Revenue.

33:04.250 --> 33:06.930
Do you mean you have someone else behind you?

33:08.700 --> 33:10.510
Actually, I've been curious

33:10.530 --> 33:12.630
why Fan Xian was chosen

33:12.650 --> 33:14.410
to take over Neiku.

33:14.460 --> 33:15.650
What secrets are lurking

33:15.650 --> 33:17.890
behind all this?

33:19.290 --> 33:21.010
Well.

33:21.530 --> 33:24.170
The less you know about it, the better it'll be.

33:25.410 --> 33:27.050
Let's wait for the result.

33:32.500 --> 33:33.380
Get started!

33:33.380 --> 33:34.480
Hold on.

33:34.500 --> 33:35.770
Mr. Fan,

33:35.860 --> 33:37.200
you don't have the right

33:37.220 --> 33:39.680
to give orders at the prefecture, right?

33:41.380 --> 33:42.770
She doesn't need to suffer

33:42.820 --> 33:44.890
if you admit.

33:45.290 --> 33:46.600
Okay.

33:50.770 --> 33:53.680
Will you admit your guilt under torture?

33:58.500 --> 34:00.460
Your servant kowtows upon seeing Your Highness.

34:00.460 --> 34:01.720
All rise.

34:01.740 --> 34:02.580
The Crown Prince is here.

34:02.580 --> 34:04.840
How can you kowtow to me?

34:09.380 --> 34:11.890
Your servant kowtows upon seeing Your Highness.

34:12.940 --> 34:14.270
Chengze.

34:14.290 --> 34:16.190
I've told you numerous times.

34:16.210 --> 34:18.450
We're brothers. You don't have to do that.

34:21.940 --> 34:23.470
You're the Crown Prince.

34:23.490 --> 34:25.080
I have to show my respect.

34:25.770 --> 34:26.920
Why are you here?

34:26.940 --> 34:28.800
To see how influential you're.

34:28.820 --> 34:30.750
With you sitting here,

34:30.770 --> 34:32.140
the Imperial Magistrate

34:32.140 --> 34:33.510
has to do as you say.

34:33.530 --> 34:35.840
It's admirable.

34:37.420 --> 34:40.160
He's the decision maker. I'm just an onlooker.

34:40.180 --> 34:41.450
Really?

34:42.250 --> 34:43.690
Yes.

34:43.690 --> 34:45.620
You were going to close the case,

34:45.620 --> 34:47.420
but why did you start to use torture suddenly?

34:47.420 --> 34:48.930
It...

34:49.620 --> 34:51.080
Go ahead.

34:52.210 --> 34:53.750
Your Highness,

34:53.770 --> 34:55.340
it's my decision.

34:55.340 --> 34:58.250
It has nothing to do with the Crown Prince.

34:58.250 --> 34:59.890
Mr. Mei, please do as you like.

35:00.140 --> 35:02.000
I'm also an onlooker.

35:02.620 --> 35:03.970
So...

35:13.660 --> 35:15.520
Your Highness, sit down please.

35:27.180 --> 35:28.050
Get started.

35:28.050 --> 35:29.600
Don't bother.

35:29.860 --> 35:30.920
Why?

35:30.940 --> 35:33.730
Mr. Fan, do you have anything to say?

35:35.690 --> 35:37.410
Thank you for showing mercy to me.

35:37.660 --> 35:38.970
I'm just a weak woman.

35:38.970 --> 35:40.560
I'm afraid I can't repay your kindness.

35:48.900 --> 35:50.640
If you plead guilty now,

35:50.660 --> 35:52.840
it means I was lying.

35:53.820 --> 35:55.800
I did it for my own sake.

35:56.140 --> 35:58.210
Guards, catch her.

36:02.250 --> 36:03.600
Get started.

36:06.860 --> 36:08.620
Let me repeat it. Si Lili,

36:08.620 --> 36:11.600
did Fan Xian leave the boat last night?

36:20.210 --> 36:22.970
He slept with me.

36:23.250 --> 36:25.080
He didn't leave.

36:25.100 --> 36:26.880
You're still lying.

36:26.900 --> 36:28.560
Harder!

36:30.730 --> 36:32.320
Mr. Mei,

36:32.820 --> 36:34.450
she's a witness,

36:34.450 --> 36:35.380
but not a suspect.

36:35.380 --> 36:36.860
She just needs to answer your questions.

36:36.860 --> 36:40.080
Why do you keep torturing her?

36:47.380 --> 36:49.890
You're right, Your Highness.

36:50.690 --> 36:54.400
Enough. If it goes on like this,

36:54.420 --> 36:57.130
people will say she admits a confession by tortures.

36:58.580 --> 37:00.000
In this case,

37:00.140 --> 37:01.490
Guo Baokun

37:01.490 --> 37:04.410
really got Fan Xian wrong.

37:05.290 --> 37:07.230
Chengze, no hurry.

37:07.250 --> 37:09.930
Don't jump to a conclusion.

37:12.380 --> 37:14.490
Take him here.

37:28.770 --> 37:30.650
Who is he?

37:33.340 --> 37:35.970
Guo Baokun said that

37:36.900 --> 37:38.970
the assailant kept asking him

37:38.970 --> 37:41.560
about Teng Zijing's family.

37:41.820 --> 37:43.050
As far as I know,

37:43.050 --> 37:45.380
Teng Zijing worked for the Investigator's Office.

37:45.380 --> 37:46.970
He was killed after the assassination in Danzhou,

37:46.970 --> 37:50.040
according to Fan Xian.

37:50.490 --> 37:51.950
So, I'm curious

37:51.970 --> 37:54.920
who wants to find

37:54.940 --> 37:55.730
his family

37:55.730 --> 37:57.650
after his death.

37:58.050 --> 38:00.520
It's more interesting upon further investigation.

38:00.900 --> 38:02.250
It turns out Teng Zijing's family

38:02.250 --> 38:04.560
has moved to somewhere outside the city.

38:04.580 --> 38:06.510
I sent guys to look for them

38:06.530 --> 38:08.760
and this guy was found.

38:09.010 --> 38:10.240
Chengze,

38:10.340 --> 38:12.130
guess who he is.

38:13.530 --> 38:15.660
He's Teng Zijing

38:15.660 --> 38:17.320
who was supposed to be dead.

38:20.900 --> 38:22.490
Interesting, right?

38:27.450 --> 38:28.840
In this case,

38:28.860 --> 38:30.290
we've got to the bottom of it.

38:30.290 --> 38:34.130
He's the assailant!

38:34.820 --> 38:36.920
But Fan Xian reported that

38:36.940 --> 38:37.690
Teng Zijing

38:37.690 --> 38:38.730
was killed.

38:38.730 --> 38:40.490
Maybe he was fooled

38:40.490 --> 38:41.970
by this guy.

38:42.620 --> 38:44.520
As far as I know,

38:44.690 --> 38:45.620
this guy has been staying with Fan Xian

38:45.620 --> 38:48.320
since he came to the capital city.

38:58.100 --> 39:00.490
He also went to the poetry gathering, right?

39:06.180 --> 39:07.800
I did see him.

39:07.820 --> 39:10.240
He's Fan Xian's bodyguard?

39:11.860 --> 39:13.080
Yes.

39:15.380 --> 39:17.560
It's more interesting.

39:17.900 --> 39:20.670
The Investigator's Office serves His Majesty.

39:20.690 --> 39:23.000
Fan Xian

39:23.420 --> 39:25.560
even reported fake news

39:25.620 --> 39:27.050
and hired a former employee

39:27.050 --> 39:29.080
of the Investigator's Office.

39:34.450 --> 39:37.000
I won't talk about the criminal law today,

39:37.180 --> 39:39.280
but by doing that,

39:40.340 --> 39:42.040
Fan Xian,

39:43.490 --> 39:47.450
you've deceived His Majesty.

40:14.050 --> 40:15.560
I threatened Fan Xian with a knife

40:15.580 --> 40:17.080
so that he had to do that.

40:17.970 --> 40:19.640
If it was true,

40:19.660 --> 40:20.660
why didn't he escape

40:20.660 --> 40:22.730
or turn to help after coming to the capital?

40:22.730 --> 40:24.080
He didn't dare

40:24.100 --> 40:25.840
to risk his life.

40:28.250 --> 40:29.920
As far as I know,

40:29.940 --> 40:33.120
Chengze, you also went to the poetry gathering, right?

40:33.140 --> 40:36.320
And you met Fan Xian in the backyard.

40:36.340 --> 40:37.970
Is it true?

40:38.690 --> 40:39.930
Yes.

40:40.050 --> 40:42.230
Fan Xian, you met Chengze alone.

40:42.250 --> 40:43.450
If you were under threat,

40:43.450 --> 40:45.640
why didn't you turn to him?

40:45.660 --> 40:47.160
So,

40:47.180 --> 40:49.600
I'd be declared guilty

40:50.380 --> 40:52.190
no matter whether I hit Guo Baokun or not.

40:52.210 --> 40:53.290
Considering you're a great poet,

40:53.290 --> 40:54.530
I'll spare your life.

40:54.530 --> 40:57.000
But I can't marry Lin Wan'er, right?

40:58.940 --> 41:00.340
I'm tired.

41:00.340 --> 41:02.650
Chengze, do you have anything else to say?

41:03.660 --> 41:05.230
Put him to torture!

41:05.250 --> 41:07.100
I'd like to see

41:07.100 --> 41:08.290
why Teng Zijing pretended to be killed

41:08.290 --> 41:09.770
and what on earth

41:09.770 --> 41:11.450
he aimed to do.

41:19.860 --> 41:22.320
Guards. Put him to torture!

41:24.770 --> 41:26.800
Hold on.

41:35.730 --> 41:37.430
Your Highness.

41:37.450 --> 41:38.890
Eunuch Hou?

41:39.660 --> 41:42.040
I'm here with His Majesty's oral instructions.

41:52.660 --> 41:54.340
"It's the Investigator's Office that

41:54.340 --> 41:57.210
asked Teng Zijing to pretend to be killed.

41:57.660 --> 41:58.970
I knew that,

41:58.970 --> 42:00.730
so it's not an offense.

42:00.940 --> 42:04.840
It's the Imperial Magistrate's duty to try a case.

42:04.860 --> 42:07.920
The members of the royal family should go back

42:07.940 --> 42:09.560
and mind your own business."

42:09.580 --> 42:11.930
Your subject obeys.

42:20.420 --> 42:21.840
Your Highness.

42:26.490 --> 42:28.080
May I

42:28.140 --> 42:29.270
take the liberty

42:29.290 --> 42:31.240
to ask you a question?

42:54.440 --> 42:58.020
In the river of history,

42:58.040 --> 43:01.510
time goes round and round.

43:04.320 --> 43:07.660
Memories about the former and present lives

43:07.680 --> 43:11.750
join each other in an endless way.

43:13.640 --> 43:16.260
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:16.280 --> 43:18.520
one season follows another in a flash,

43:18.520 --> 43:21.020
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:21.040 --> 43:22.640
I just can't give up

43:22.640 --> 43:25.980
to be with you for my whole life.

43:26.000 --> 43:31.470
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:32.720 --> 43:35.270
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:35.560 --> 43:37.600
Year after year in the wandering,

43:37.600 --> 43:40.260
I count the remaining years.

43:40.280 --> 43:42.460
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:42.480 --> 43:44.470
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:44.760 --> 43:47.150
I never feel regretful.

43:47.200 --> 43:48.560
In such a chaotic world,

43:48.560 --> 43:51.540
I still miss you as ever.

43:51.560 --> 43:54.510
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

43:54.800 --> 43:56.860
With a gentle heart,

43:56.880 --> 43:59.540
I cherish our remaining years.

43:59.560 --> 44:01.080
Even though we have to go through

44:01.080 --> 44:03.590
all the hardships along the journey,

44:03.720 --> 44:10.910
you always stay by my side,

44:11.000 --> 44:13.670
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:13.960 --> 44:16.040
Year after year in the wandering,

44:16.040 --> 44:18.700
I count the remaining years.

44:18.720 --> 44:20.860
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:20.880 --> 44:23.110
even though we end up the destiny,

44:23.320 --> 44:25.500
I never feel regretful.

44:25.520 --> 44:26.920
In such a chaotic world,

44:26.920 --> 44:29.980
I still miss you as ever.

44:30.000 --> 44:33.110
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:33.200 --> 44:35.340
With a gentle heart,

44:35.360 --> 44:38.060
I cherish our remaining years.

44:38.080 --> 44:39.520
Even though we have to go through

44:39.520 --> 44:42.180
all the hardships along the journey,

44:42.200 --> 44:50.960
you always stay by my side...
